<km-title nodeId="6facc06995dc481fb6b8f4d752eaaff2">策略评估-评估任务</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="893164b04d1842ff9520356c6a342977" />
<h2 nodeId="c060f5768776487a8a547cf87a1a287c">一、背景</h2>
<p align="start" nodeId="c15e27dda08c400a8e69642bb1a636e9">相见策略评估的背景</p>
<h2 align="start" nodeId="179dc67229fe485ba0dd273dc040a29d">二、名词解释</h2>
<p align="start" nodeId="3287f103f7844c88bd29147d3f4f203b">评估任务：在指定时间段内对指定场景规则，利用日志计算指标并判断是否符合预期的任务</p>
<p nodeId="73530e3f402a434c995ba49d54141027"><strong>一期仅支持自动生成标记评估任务。</strong></p>
<h2 align="start" nodeId="daa625d6320342209b345cead8e8a01d">三、操作指南</h2>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="0203c86b01324252937d49092bbe48c7">1.用户操作流程说明</h3>
<table borderColor="#cccccc" responsive="false" nodeId="17fdd9092dd64d6f87a4047cd0714eca">
