<th colwidth="[603]" nodeId="65a56eaca7c64c14aedb8581700809d3">
<p nodeId="93d65e4614b74d53a4164a35661d7ba9"><span font-size="14">说明</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[741]" nodeId="d23943fee8a64edc8e2571d2352bc848">
<p nodeId="ad9d7bbc8cb0405c92ab2e1038b705d3"><span font-size="14">页面</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="a8cc8263377c480d8a4dc4197a78cb7e">
<td colwidth="[603]" nodeId="ea58c93eb12e42d684bd1d40e593dd3c">
<p nodeId="0b7a5d599b66404c9cbd3d40af816a32"><span font-size="14">任务生成</span></p>
<ol nodeId="652ce1cbca3b43b5ab7e5942014709e9">
<li nodeId="32f1da92423c413bb0ae7e672f4ab431"><span font-size="14">添加场景配置时，可选择该规则在该场景下是否开启评估。</span></li>
<li nodeId="fae33b00b23d44d497be0b3b50a674f8"><span font-size="14">选择「否」，无需选择模板，也不会开启评估任务；</span></li>
<li nodeId="e24a481ca8c648f1b412c51ba61bc5ce"><span font-size="14">选择「是」，跳出「评估模板」下拉选项，可选择已经就绪的模板，点击提交后，自动生成评估任务</span></li>
</ol>
</td>
<td colwidth="[741]" nodeId="e7884cc13ce94df89702ca4114edecb2">
<p nodeId="13c47da3dcde4c8a971372c214014481"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1226555790/1392882770?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="719" height="262" nodeId="a5cfa843975545f28a69a5711b624265" /></p>
<p nodeId="14877641585b4cb481607d313acc6e9c"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1226555790/1392866889?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="719" height="272" nodeId="df860768c61748d08abb8da69652a7ce" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="989ecc6ff9b648ee89d42ed07b2d2a5f">
<td colwidth="[603]" nodeId="71e77d121ab84a6092a7d790eda8e64f">
<p nodeId="d75b4dfc1d384bd1983191f02a9c163d"><span font-size="14">评估任务查看</span></p>
<p nodeId="e2e15bc9bfad4ffa88f4adca7d69c88f"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">zeus--&gt;策略评估--&gt;评估任务--&gt;自动任务tab</span></span></p>
<ol nodeId="31cc974049014fd295d337929b516ebe">
<li nodeId="8606aa2aa36747fbbdb50d9dc00027f6"><span font-size="14">系统自动生成的评估任务会在该页面展示。</span></li>
<li nodeId="5bb465eb73e64bffa684acdf8fafdce8"><span font-size="14">任务ID支持点击，超链接至任务去详情页；</span></li>
<li nodeId="3580578ec5d54bcf9a6fec5b94a952d1"><span font-size="14">评估模板支持点击，超链接至模板详情页；</span></li>
<li nodeId="051bff51b32e442cb30cac8c50dddf40"><span font-size="14">规则支持点击，超链接至规则详情页；</span></li>
<li nodeId="3246121928a042a589e354e19da3a8a9"><span font-size="14">场景支持点击，超链接至场景规则配置；</span></li>
<li nodeId="983c079998694066af1d4b98be477605"><span font-size="14">状态有评估中、评估完成；</span></li>
<li nodeId="6b68c8b6d0bf4403a9882627d9128012">
<p nodeId="6f62249a79494097a92637f9066894c3"><span font-size="14">评估结果有通过、不通过；</span></p>
<p nodeId="e71f6be3130548ebb0b446c34c534796" />
</li>
<li nodeId="67c69a0ab8984f17b08e6d6c04f82ced"><span font-size="14">针对评估中的，没有评估结果；评估完成的，结果可以是通过、不通过</span></li>
<li nodeId="efd860ca4e3543b0927aff5de0dc3098"><span font-size="14">针对评估结果不通过的任务/评估结果通过但是模板是人工属性的任务，规则状态为「标记」，需要进行人工操作；</span></li>
<li nodeId="0ab55530c1b449a0acdb17d9cd1a0410"><span font-size="14">评估结果通过但是模板是人工属性的任务，在1）任务详情页人工操作可以生效或灰度，2）大象通知里确认上线，3）原场景规则配置里进行生效或灰度；</span></li>
<li nodeId="d69088ba65974945aa8945c9e124b462"><span font-size="14">评估结果不通过的任务，可以强制上线或者发起运营复核</span></li>
<li nodeId="58ea77b42cda4cb8baefc94073bba017"><span font-size="14">运营复核配置请参考</span><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1227436889" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1227436889" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="2ad014f6f35c4bd988200ddf544d5b8d"><span font-size="14">https://km.sankuai.com/page/1227436889</span></a></li>
</ol>
<p nodeId="6bf27bcb0cd34acdb6798417f4f42fac"><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">注意：目前仅对businessid=1的业务配置了运营复核场景，如果其他业务空间的用户也想使用运营复核功能，请联系平台产品</span></span><km-mention name="丁婷婷" uid="dingtingting04" empId="" nodeId="c7b43686cb5d4f4a94afd5395fe2d6ea" /><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">（zeus侧） </span></span><km-mention name="姚珍珍" uid="yaozhenzhen" empId="" nodeId="49608ba330f94b488c145d0d7b009c7a" /><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">（运营侧）</span></span></p>
</td>
